## ObjectType: measurement information content entity

Source label: measurement information content entity. Source IRI: `https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MeasurementInformationContentEntity`. Source definition: informational content that is the result of measuring a set of attributes (specifically dependent continuant or process characteristic or temporal region) belonging to the entity (independent continuant or process or process boundary) the informational content is about

